DESCRIPTION:AWS re:Invent 2025 livestream\n\nExperience re:Invent virtually
	. Watch keynotes and Innovation Talks in real time for the latest announce
	ments\, plus access all breakout sessions on-demand—completely free.\n\n
	More info > https://reinvent.awsevents.com/livestream/?trk=c2d99bec-d9d5-4
	d48-8729-c04120146032\n\nWatch here > https://reinvent.awslivestream.com/\
