	46032\n \n- CEO Keynote with Matt Garman\n  Matt Garman\, AWS CEO\n  Tuesd
	ay\, Dec 2 | 8:00 AM – 10:30 AM (PST)\n 	\n- The Future of Agentic AI is
	 Here\n  Swami Sivasubramanian\, Vice President of Agentic AI\, AWS\n  Wed
	nesday\, Dec 3 | 8:30 AM– 10:30 AM (PST)\n\n- The Partnership Advantage\
	n  Dr. Ruba Borno\, VP Global Specialties and Partners\, AWS\n  Wednesday 
	Dec 3 | 3:00 PM – 4:30 PM (PST)\n \n- Infrastructure Innovations\n  Pete
	r DeSantis\, SVP Utility Computing AWS and Dave Brown\, VP Compute and Mac
	hine Learning Services\, AWS \n  Thursday\, Dec 4 | 9:00 AM – 10:30 AM (
	PST)\n \n- A Special Closing Keynote with Dr. Werner Vogels\n  Dr. Werner 
	Vogels\, CTO\, Amazon.com\n  Thursday\, Dec 4 | 3:30 PM – 4:30 PM (PST)\
	n\n-----\nInnovation Talks\nhttps://reinvent.awsevents.com/innovation-talk
	s/?trk=c2d99bec-d9d5-4d48-8729-c04120146032\n\nInnovation Talks are deep-d
	ive sessions featuring AWS thought leaders and experts who break down the 
	latest technologies and strategies shaping the future of cloud computing.\
	n\n- Monday\, Dec. 1 – Thursday\, Dec. 4 | 9:00 AM – 12:00 PM (PST) \n
	- 15 sessions with AWS VPs and Distinguished Engineers covering AI\, analy
	tics\, security\, and more\n\n-----\nRoad to re:Invent\n\n50 developers. 1
	0 teams. One epic journey. Watch as competitors race against time during t
	he ultimate hackathon\, coding their way through the desert on a high-stak
	es bus journey from Los Angeles to Las Vegas.\n\n- Sunday\, Nov. 30 | 11:0
	0 AM – 7:00 PM (PST)\n
